# White Tiger, Ava Ayala: The Tiger God's "can't be blocked by more than one creature" is an ability of the token (CR 509.1b,
# 113.1a), so a Tiger God that loses all abilities may be blocked by any number (CR 613.1f). Bot1 powers up the turn White Tiger
# enters ({4}), then on turn 3 turns its own Tiger God into a 1/1 Frog with Turn to Frog and attacks: Bot2's two Ornithopters both
# block it; neither has power to deal it damage, and its 1 damage kills neither (0/2s).

